{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken in the Serene Estates, a vast underground housing facility built to shelter humanity from the dangers of the outside world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.poster.avif?t=1774377238\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.webm?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.mp4?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations, its residents have lived in controlled comfort, their lives guided and monitored by the omnipresent AI matron, Serena. Order was promised. Safety was guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something has gone wrong. You are\u00a0<strong>D-5.Omega</strong>, one of the last conscious residents to awaken from a life spent inside the simulated dream of the Actuaverse. Small, fragile, and unprepared, you must now navigate a facility that has come alive in ways it should not have. Every corridor is watched, every system is armed, and Serena herself has marked you as an intruder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Living Machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serene Estates was built on security, and its systems will not let you go without a fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/da7093c7d902b949b7764b0ec7e497fc.avif?t=1774377238\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Drones</strong> patrol the air, able to repair, maintain, and eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Security</strong> cameras are Serena\u2019s eyes. Step into their vision and alarms, locks, and worse will follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Turrets</strong> deploy automatically, shredding anything caught in their sights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Hazards of the facility</strong> itself\u2014electrified water, industrial fans, toxic gas, and endless shafts\u2014turn the structure into a labyrinth of lethal design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.poster.avif?t=1774377238\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.webm?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.mp4?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tools of a Survivor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though frail, D-5.Omega is not powerless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Climb and traverse hidden routes to outmaneuver surveillance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Hack terminals to seize control of RC drones, turning Serena\u2019s machines against her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Use energy cells to power up dormant systems, open locked paths, or manipulate the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.poster.avif?t=1774377238\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.webm?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.mp4?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items of Hope</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Soy Breeze vending machines keep you alive with a health boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Bug Lite, rare and hidden, permanently expands your health pool when found and purchased with special tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Escape Keys unlock the pods of still-sleeping residents. Collect them all to rescue everyone and reach the best ending.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/a49cbd7153be87b3b720ac630ba10b71.avif?t=1774377238\" width=1200 height=388 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Atmospheric exploration through a colossal underground facility built on order and surveillance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Stealth and strategy to avoid cameras, alarms, and patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Deadly hazards and enemies that force creative navigation and quick thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Hacking and drone control for indirect combat and puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Lore-rich environments that reveal the unsettling truths behind Serene Estates, its corporate backers, and the Actuaverse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Multiple endings depending on how many you save or leave behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e936823208d808b2713c2ecd702bac0b.avif?t=1774377238\" width=1496 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Life inside Serene Estates was supposed to be safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now the walls themselves have become a prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you escape Serena\u2019s grasp, or be her last obedient resident?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/88f28643a5720151adddf6ca79eabf58.avif?t=1774377238\" width=1560 height=511 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lights Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/52eafd0e2781d0a17fb2c401cd516c1c88bb970a.jpg"},{"name":"Feel the Breeze!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/96e0371136132606d600e5d6c38f90ed04903bb0.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Equipped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/34a8cecf889e682007be458051fa29d352f1dbac.jpg"},{"name":"Drink the Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/273f911ac6a226a47370af2f264c6a413a29ca0d.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh(er) Air","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/4d49ddab51718b81485c753aa0d7fb631f727f38.jpg"},{"name":"Plug the Drains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/bba45026c6bd40cf7093fe1639c17c419c7e75e4.jpg"},{"name":"Taking out the Trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/73e67d58ae3dfcfc11f1353c3054a4a793299595.jpg"},{"name":"Pleased to Meet You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/9283858ca1cadd15a76f13dd1912e445a1685993.jpg"},{"name":"I'll Take That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/ba537c897cfe44c6915d2299738c16c6afc03faa.jpg"},{"name":"Reuinited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724910/7b4631cd96ba05957b195d55ad5f50960f8d575b.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724910?t=1774377238","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/e174df4e6252dfed29ce1ccf0b7f17e6f4f2c9c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774377238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/cf5bf522e263b3cb97d042795920acb229db2d79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774377238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/cf5bf522e263b3cb97d042795920acb229db2d79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774377238","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken in the Serene Estates, a vast underground housing facility built to shelter humanity from the dangers of the outside world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.poster.avif?t=1774377238\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.webm?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.mp4?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations, its residents have lived in controlled comfort, their lives guided and monitored by the omnipresent AI matron, Serena. Order was promised. Safety was guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something has gone wrong. You are\u00a0<strong>D-5.Omega</strong>, one of the last conscious residents to awaken from a life spent inside the simulated dream of the Actuaverse. Small, fragile, and unprepared, you must now navigate a facility that has come alive in ways it should not have. Every corridor is watched, every system is armed, and Serena herself has marked you as an intruder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Living Machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serene Estates was built on security, and its systems will not let you go without a fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/da7093c7d902b949b7764b0ec7e497fc.avif?t=1774377238\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Drones</strong> patrol the air, able to repair, maintain, and eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Security</strong> cameras are Serena\u2019s eyes. Step into their vision and alarms, locks, and worse will follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Turrets</strong> deploy automatically, shredding anything caught in their sights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Hazards of the facility</strong> itself\u2014electrified water, industrial fans, toxic gas, and endless shafts\u2014turn the structure into a labyrinth of lethal design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.poster.avif?t=1774377238\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.webm?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.mp4?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tools of a Survivor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though frail, D-5.Omega is not powerless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Climb and traverse hidden routes to outmaneuver surveillance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Hack terminals to seize control of RC drones, turning Serena\u2019s machines against her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Use energy cells to power up dormant systems, open locked paths, or manipulate the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.poster.avif?t=1774377238\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.webm?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.mp4?t=1774377238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items of Hope</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Soy Breeze vending machines keep you alive with a health boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Bug Lite, rare and hidden, permanently expands your health pool when found and purchased with special tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Escape Keys unlock the pods of still-sleeping residents. Collect them all to rescue everyone and reach the best ending.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/a49cbd7153be87b3b720ac630ba10b71.avif?t=1774377238\" width=1200 height=388 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Atmospheric exploration through a colossal underground facility built on order and surveillance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Stealth and strategy to avoid cameras, alarms, and patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Deadly hazards and enemies that force creative navigation and quick thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Hacking and drone control for indirect combat and puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Lore-rich environments that reveal the unsettling truths behind Serene Estates, its corporate backers, and the Actuaverse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Multiple endings depending on how many you save or leave behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"b